OL,3,GNEWSALibrary closes for a week to
OL,4,Ainstall new lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's library has closed for a week
OL,7,Fto install new lighting after its
OL,8,Ffailing fixtures made it hard to see
OL,9,Finside.
OL,11,FWorkington Library will be temporarily
OL,12,Fshut until Monday 12 October while work
OL,13,Fis done on the ground floor of the
OL,14,Fbuilding.
OL,16,FCumberland Council said the lights had
OL,17,Freached the end of their operational
OL,18,Flife, adding: "Over recent months,
OL,19,Ffailing fixtures have become
OL,20,Firreparable and obsolete with
OL,21,Freplacement parts no longer available,
OL,22,Faffecting visibility in this area."
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
