OL,3,GNEWSALibrary closes for a week to
OL,4,Ainstall new lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said the essential works
OL,7,Fwould help create a "brighter, more
OL,8,Fwelcoming environment for customers and
OL,9,Fstaff and form part of ongoing
OL,10,Finvestment in the library building".
